About Atos Group

Atos Group is a global leader in digital transformation with c. 54,000 employees and annual revenue of c. €7.2 billion (at the go-forward perimeter), operating in 54 countries under two brands - Atos for services and Eviden for products and systems. European number one in cybersecurity and a leader in cloud, Atos Group is committed to a secure and decarbonized future and provides tailored AI-powered, end-to-end solutions for all industries. Atos Group is listed on Euronext Paris.

About Eviden

Eviden is the Atos Group brand focused on cybersecurity products, mission-critical systems and vision AI. A trusted partner to public and private sector organizations, Eviden deploys advanced analytics capabilities and helps ensure the robustness, continuity and resilience of its customers’ operations. Leveraging more than 2,200 experts and 720 patents, Eviden helps protect people, data and critical infrastructures worldwide, at the convergence of intelligence, sovereignty and trust.

Key Skills For The Role

Proven experience in Java EE, Spring, Servlets, Web Services (REST, SOAP), JPA, Hibernate;
Experience with client-server based technologies and SW architecture practices;
Good understanding of various Databases, UI frameworks, deployment environments;
Experience with version control (GIT) and application servers (Tomcat, Jetty);
Practitioner of Unit Testing (JUnit, Mockito), Continuous Integration, Build Automation, and Agile

Methodologies;

Knowledge about Agile Scrum/Kanban principles;
Experienced with Angular;
English at a very good level; German is a plus.

Daily Responsibilities

Technical ownership of dedicated modules/streams inside the project;
Design and implement new features;
Implementation of standard methodologies, SOLID principles;
Refactor and improve the existing code base
Participate in code reviews and coaching and mentoring of less experienced team members;
Work close with the QA-Team for implementing features/bug fixes;
Contribution to the SW development community within the company;
To promote out-of-the-box thinking and ideas.

What We Offer

We are a company that supports employee happiness as well as company growth. Atos offers not only a high

reaching and exciting workplace but also a rewarding work experience, with competitive pay and benefits

packages

